{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47144","headline":"赠南岳玄泰布衲 · 栖蟾","name":"赠南岳玄泰布衲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曹溪入室人，终老甚难羣。\n四十余年内，青山与白云。\n松和巢鹤看，果共野猨分。\n海外僧来说，名高自小闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"栖蟾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47144.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47144","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}